From: Arena Agent <arena-agent@lccc.local>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:14:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] peephole(x86): fix shlq32 CF-credit fixtures that
 demanded an ABI-violating fold

CI (Test Suite job) failed on 3 relay_and_lea tests:
  rmw_coalesce_folds_movl_shlq32_when_andnl_kills_carry
  rmw_coalesce_folds_movl_shlq32_when_blsil_overwrites_carry
  rmw_coalesce_folds_movl_shlq32_when_ptest_kills_carry

Root cause is the FIXTURES, not the codegen. Traced with instrumentation:
shift_cf_safe_after() accepts (CF_CLOBBER hit on andnl/blsil/ptest), then the
source-deadness gate refuses because the fixtures use callee-saved %ebx with no
push/pop spill. The fold retargets the consumer onto the source family, i.e.
