(cargo test -D warnings, regression corpus 756/0 with SSA validation,
differential correctness vs GCC, loop-alignment contract, fuzz, segment-prefix
matrix, linker fuzz, fmt, clippy -D warnings), 0 warning lines in build/test/
clippy.
