From 0372ffac3256ed6fae16b03fa1e28ce442c47e75 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arena Agent <arena-agent@lccc.local>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:57:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] gitignore: CI job outputs (regression/bench results,
 bench-artifacts)

Every gate in ci.yml and bench.yml writes its result files into the checkout
root, and CI only ever uploads them (actions/upload-artifact) - it never
commits. A local replication of the full CI surface followed by `git add -A`
swept 114 of them into a commit, including bench-artifacts/**/benchmark.bin
executables and 6.9k lines of generated assembly, which inflated a one-file
soundness fix into a 115-file patch.

Same failure mode the file already records twice (@PROFDIR@ 'once polluted a
format-patch with .gcda binary blobs', and the `-` stdout capture 'got swept
by git add -A in aa1956b and 12eed2b'), so the guard belongs here rather than
in every contributor's memory. Names are taken from the workflow steps:
regression-results.{json,log}, ci-regression-environment.txt,
inline-asm-utf8.json, bench-{results.json,summary.md,terminal.txt},
bench-artifacts/, codegen-gate.txt.
---
 .gitignore | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.gitignore b/.gitignore
index ebe3f77c..5d943d2d 100644
--- a/.gitignore
+++ b/.gitignore
@@ -91,3 +91,18 @@ zlib-ng-validation/
 /scripts/qemu_icount_plugin/*.so
 ms178-1.patch
 tool-results/
+
+# CI job outputs: every gate writes these into the checkout root, and CI only
+# ever UPLOADS them (actions/upload-artifact), never commits them. A local
+# replication run followed by `git add -A` swept 114 of them - including
+# bench-artifacts/**/benchmark.bin executables - into a49c755a, the same
+# failure mode as the @PROFDIR@ and `-` entries above.
+/regression-results.json
+/regression-results.log
+/ci-regression-environment.txt
+/inline-asm-utf8.json
+/bench-results.json
+/bench-summary.md
+/bench-terminal.txt
+/bench-artifacts/
+/codegen-gate.txt
